<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our neighbors at the Commons, many of whom are navigating the trauma of decades of homelessness and poverty, know this truth: systems are failing. No one is coming to fix it for them. And still, they show up, helping us all hold onto the fragile yet vital hope that belonging and community can override even the deepest despair, whether political, personal, or global.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
